# Canonical Context Files

Before changing gameplay, controls, maze generation, rendering, or menu behavior, read these files first:

- `docs/GAME_DESIGN.md` (canonical game design and mechanics)
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` (high-level project architecture)
- `README.md` (build, run, deploy commands and environment assumptions)

When behavior in code and docs differs:

- Treat code as source of runtime truth.
- Update `docs/GAME_DESIGN.md` in the same task so docs stay current.

For menu-specific work, also check:

- `src/ui/MenuScreen.h`
- `src/ui/MenuScreen.cpp`
- `src/ui/ConfirmationDialog.h`
- `src/ui/ConfirmationDialog.cpp`
